---
import MathLayout from '../../../layouts/MathLayout.astro';
import { getPath } from '../../../utils/path';

const lang = 'en';
const currentPath = '/en/university/topology';
const title = 'Topology';
---

<MathLayout {title} {lang} {currentPath}>
	<article>
		<h1>{title}</h1>
		<p class="intro">Topology studies the continuity and neighborhood relations of spaces. It doesn't care about exact distances or angles, but about the more essential structure of "which points are close together".</p>

		<h2>Core Concept: Properties Invariant Under Continuous Deformation</h2>
		<div class="concept-card card">
			<p>Homeomorphism - two spaces that can be continuously stretched, bent but not torn or glued together are considered "the same" in topology. A coffee cup and a donut are homeomorphic.</p>
	</div>

		<h2>Open Set Axioms</h2>
		<div class="concepts-grid">
			<div class="concept-card card">
				<h3>Empty Set and Whole Space</h3>
				<p>∅ and X are both open sets</p>
			</div>
			<div class="concept-card card">
				<h3>Arbitrary Union</h3>
				<p>Arbitrary union of open sets is open</p>
			</div>
			<div class="concept-card card">
				<h3>Finite Intersection</h3>
				<p>Finite intersection of open sets is open</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>Important Theorems</h2>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>Brouwer Fixed Point Theorem</h3>
			<p>Every continuous map from a disk to itself has a fixed point. This is a direct manifestation of the Second Principle - you cannot escape from inside.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>Jordan Curve Theorem</h3>
			<p>Every simple closed curve in the plane divides the plane into interior and exterior regions.</p>
		</div>

		<h2>Learning Path</h2>
		<div class="learning-path">
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">1</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Point-Set Topology</h3>
					<p>Open sets, closed sets, neighborhoods, continuous maps</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">2</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Connectedness and Compactness</h3>
					<p>Connected sets, path-connectedness, fundamental group</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">3</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Homotopy and Fundamental Group</h3>
					<p>Homotopy equivalence, covering spaces, group cohomology</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">4</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Homology</h3>
					<p>Simplicial homology, singular homology, cohomology</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>Connections to Other Subjects</h2>
		<div class="connections">
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">⟷</span>
				<span>Analysis - continuous maps, calculus on open sets</span>
			</div>
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">⟷</span>
				<span>Group Theory - algebraic topology, fundamental group</span>
			</div>
			<div class="connection-item">
				<span class="conn-icon">⟷</span>
				<span>Category Theory - toposes</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="nav-footer">
			<a href={getPath('/en/university')} class="back-link">← Back to University Math</a>
		</div>
	</article>
</MathLayout>

<style>
	.intro {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.concepts-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.concept-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.theorem-card {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.1);
		border-color: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.3);
	}

	.theorem-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.theorem-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.learning-path {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.path-step {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.path-step:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.step-num {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 2rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #ec4899);
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.step-content h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.step-content p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.connections {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}

	.connection-item {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 0.75rem;
		background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.05);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.conn-icon {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: #f43f5e;
	}

	.nav-footer {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: #f43f5e;
	}
</style>
